        'The packaging side of the problem is just as significant as the chemical side. Most conventional cleaners arrive in single-use plastic spray bottles that get thrown away once empty, and a household using a steady rotation of disposable cleaning products throws away a meaningful number of plastic bottles every single year, a waste stream entirely separate from the cleaning chemicals themselves.',
